# Preserve old Wix URLs
/locations             /                       301!
/copy-of-find-a-unit   /                       301!
/book-now              /                       301!

# .html -> extensionless redirects
# The trailing `!` forces the redirect even though Netlify's pretty-URLs
# feature would otherwise silently drop these rules. Without it, every
# .html URL serves 200 directly and Google ends up with both the .html
# and the clean URL competing for the same content in its index.
/index.html                /                            301!
/blog.html                 /blog                        301!
/size-guide.html           /size-guide                  301!
/tenant-protection.html    /tenant-protection           301!
/security.html             /security                    301!
/faq.html                  /faq                         301!
/privacy-policy.html       /privacy-policy              301!
/terms.html                /terms                       301!
/storage-near-chanute.html      /storage-near-chanute         301!
/storage-near-coffeyville.html  /storage-near-coffeyville     301!
/storage-near-joplin.html       /storage-near-joplin          301!

# Blog post .html redirects
# Wildcard (/posts/*.html) does NOT work for partial-segment .html
# suffix matching in Netlify — splat is greedy and the rule silently
# misses. Listed explicitly per post to ensure each one fires.
/posts/why-storage-facility-security-matters.html       /posts/why-storage-facility-security-matters        301!
/posts/storage-solutions-labette-county-homeowners.html /posts/storage-solutions-labette-county-homeowners  301!
/posts/moving-to-parsons.html                           /posts/moving-to-parsons                            301!
/posts/choosing-right-storage-unit-size.html            /posts/choosing-right-storage-unit-size             301!
/posts/protect-belongings-kansas-humidity.html          /posts/protect-belongings-kansas-humidity           301!
/posts/self-storage-makes-moving-easier.html            /posts/self-storage-makes-moving-easier             301!
/posts/what-is-tenant-protection.html                   /posts/what-is-tenant-protection                    301!
